Subject: [PATCH] minimum arm64: ship the image translators

The minimum profile's SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_TRANSLATORS is STXTTranslator alone.
ShowImage is on the image but could open nothing, and a JPEG chosen in
Backgrounds was never drawn on the desktop (Tracker found no translator
for it).

JPEG, PNG, WebP and AVIF translators need libjpeg-turbo, libpng, libwebp
and libavif as build features, i.e. -devel packages, and arm64 HaikuPorts
publishes none of them. The image already carries the runtime libraries
(haikuwebkit bundles libjpeg.so.62, libpng16.so.16 and libwebp.so.7;
libavif1.0 has libavif.so.16), so the translators are built against those
outside this tree and added as a prebuilt package, as 0014 does for
WebPositive: renku_imagetranslators in ../packages/, staged into download/
by build-renku-arm64-iso.sh. It holds AVIF, BMP, GIF, HVIF, ICO, JPEG,
PCX, PNG, PPM, PSD, RAW, RTF, SGI, TGA, WebP and WonderBrush, built from
this tree's sources (8484655099) with a forced-include header that gives
them a correct float byte swap (see 0021) and the
B_TRANSLATOR_EXT_DOCUMENT_COUNT/INDEX strings, so the same package also
works on images built before 0021 and before 13a583a7f0.

Vendor is "Haiku Project", as this build's local repository requires (see
0020).

diff --git a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
--- a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
+++ b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
@@ -249,6 +249,19 @@
 					rappmarket
 					;
 			}
+
+			# The image translators. The minimum profile ships STXTTranslator
+			# alone, so ShowImage opened nothing and a picture chosen as the
+			# desktop background was never drawn. JPEG, PNG, WebP and AVIF
+			# need libjpeg-turbo, libpng, libwebp and libavif, which arm64
+			# HaikuPorts does not publish as -devel packages for this tree to
+			# build against; the package is prebuilt against the copies the
+			# image already has (haikuwebkit, libavif1.0), like webpositive.
+			if $(TARGET_PACKAGING_ARCH) = arm64 {
+				AddHaikuImageSystemPackages
+					renku_imagetranslators
+					;
+			}
 		}
 
 		case "test-*" : {
diff --git a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
--- a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
+++ b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
@@ -74,6 +74,9 @@
 	openssh-10.4p1-1
 	# R AppMarket -- published in RENKU Apps, same as curl/gzip/tar/wget above.
 	rappmarket-1.0.0-4
+	# The image translators, prebuilt against haikuwebkit's libjpeg-turbo,
+	# libpng and libwebp and libavif1.0's libavif (see DefaultBuildProfiles).
+	renku_imagetranslators-1.0.0-1
 	:
 	# source packages
 	bash
